@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@accessToken = <paste-local-token>

### Local physician login; password comes from the HTTP client's environment.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: es

{"email":"doctor@example.test","password":"{{$env.LOCAL_DOCTOR_PASSWORD}}"}

### Own profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Missing token: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Accept-Language: es

### Malformed token: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid.jwt.value

### Allowed preflight
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Origin: http://localhost:4200
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Authorization
